      text Latest updates and announcements. @36,102,632,21
      h2 October 2026 - Trace, Code Block and AI Elements @36,135,632,21
      text Today, we are releasing two new components, and , and , a set of patterns for agentic interfaces built from shadcn/ui components. @36,168,632,40
      row @36,220,632,21
        link Trace /docs/components/base/trace @36,220,39,21
