      text Trace and Code Block are available for Base UI, React Aria and Radix across all eight styles. @36,253,632,20
      h2 Trace# @36,285,632,21
      text Trace is a list of lines for the steps an agent takes. We built it by studying hundreds of components from agentic interfaces and distilling what they share into one composition you can reuse. @36,318,632,61
      card @36,391,632,536
        text Why does pnpm install fail in CI? @53,406,598,21
        button "Thought for 5s" @53,439,598,36
        button "Ran pnpm --version" @53,487,598,36
        button "Ran git diff --stat HEAD~1 -- package.json pnpm-lock.yaml" @53,535,598,36
        card @53,583,598,51
          text package.json | 2 +- 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-) @70,598,564,21
        button "Failed to run pnpm install --frozen-lockfile" @53,646,598,36
        button "Used 2 sources" @53,694,598,36
        text The last commit bumped a version in package.json without updating pnpm-lock.yaml, so the frozen install fails. Run pnpm install locally and commit the lockfile. @53,742,598,41
        button Replay @53,795,598,36
        text "use client" import * as React from "react" @53,843,598,21
        button "View Code" @53,876,598,36
      text Reasoning, tool calls, sources, plans and subagent runs all have the same shape: something the agent did, and what happened. In Trace, each one is a line with an icon, a title, and an optional description and status. A line can expand to show more detail, link to a page, or open a dialog or sheet, so every step looks and behaves the same in your interface. @36,939,632,81
      text running, error and pending states, with a shimmer while a step runs. @36,1032,632,20
      text Lines that expand, link out, or open a dialog, sheet, drawer or popover. @36,1064,632,21
      text Nested lines, so a summary expands into steps and a step into its output. @36,1097,632,20
      text Works with the reasoning, tool and source parts from the AI SDK. @36,1129,632,20
      text Keyboard and screen reader support from the trigger that wraps each line. @36,1161,632,21
