      h2 Building agentic interfaces# @36,1883,632,22
      text Trace and Code Block join the we released in June. Together, they cover every part of an agentic interface: @36,1917,632,40
      link "components for chat interfaces" /docs/changelog/2026-06-chat-components @36,1969,632,20
      text holds the thread. It anchors each turn, follows the reply while it streams and loads history without jumping. @36,2001,632,41
      link "Message Scroller" /docs/components/base/message-scroller @36,2054,632,20
      text is one turn, with an avatar, a header and a footer for actions. @36,2086,632,21
