        button Copy @53,4657,598,36
      text It rewrites imports, replaces calls and removes the old packages when nothing references them anymore. See the for details. @36,4720,632,41
      text twMerge(clsx(...)) @36,4773,632,20
      link "CLI docs" /docs/cli#migrate-cn @36,4805,632,20
      h2 August 2026 - Private GitHub Registries @36,4837,632,21
      text GitHub registries now work with private repositories. @36,4870,632,21
      text In June, we made it possible to turn any public GitHub repository into a registry. Teams asked for the same thing for their internal code: design systems, feature kits, agent rules and conventions that should not be public. @36,4903,632,61
      text You can now install from private repositories. If you can read the repository, the CLI can install from it. @36,4976,632,40
      card @36,5028,632,149
        row @53,5043,598,71
